'''Nicalis, Inc.''' is an indie video game publisher, famous for developing and publishing ''The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth'' and its DLCs- ''Afterbirth,'' ''Afterbirth+'' ''and Repentance''. It was founded by Tyrone Rodriguez in 2007.

